From 9b92760078e393483410cba7aadf687767ac5666 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:36:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: implings (catching, jar loot and crystal implings)

Catching implings in Puro-Puro and Gielinor with a wielded butterfly net (or
10 extra Hunter levels barehanded) and an impling jar. Impling data is a
server-only dbtable impling_types (56002, rows 60152-60162) in the new
content/skills/hunter pack: npc, Puro-Puro npc, jar, level, Puro-Puro and
Gielinor XP, respawn ticks.

Looting a caught impling jar rolls the jar's loot table (from the OSRS Wiki
impling jar pages; the lucky impling's clue table is not covered).

Crystal implings: one per world in Prifddinas, at one of 12 spots as one of
the 17 named implings, a new one 3 minutes after each :00 and :30 (UTC) and
one at server start; Hunter 80 (90 barehanded), 280 XP. The catch chance
uses the generic impling curve.

Integration tests: ImplingScriptTest, ImplingLootScriptTest,
CrystalImplingScriptTest.
